abstract: >-
  Replication and extension of an empirical evaluation of LLM-based approaches to code
  vulnerability detection (RAG, SFT, Dual-Agent) on Big-Vul, with GAN-style and Triple-Agent
  strategy loops. Code of a Bachelor's thesis at Leipzig University.
keywords:
  - vulnerability detection
  - large language models
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - QLoRA
